---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="PCLAF — Tecnología que vuelve a funcionar" description="Servicio técnico de PC, notebooks y equipos gamer en Floresta. Diagnóstico honesto, presupuesto claro y reparación profesional.">
  <Navigation />
  <main>
    <section class="hero"><div class="hero-grid"></div><div class="hero-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> Taller abierto · Floresta, CABA</p><h1>Arreglamos<br /><span>lo que otros</span><br />dan por perdido.</h1><p class="hero-text">Servicio técnico para PC, notebooks y equipos gamer. Diagnóstico real, explicación clara y soluciones que duran.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-orange" href="/turnos.html">Reservar turno <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#servicios">Ver cómo ayudamos <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-meta"><span><b>+10</b> años</span><span><b>4.9</b> Google</span><span><b>100%</b> diagnóstico previo</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual reveal-delay"><div class="scan-line"></div><img src="/images/pclaf-hardware.png" alt="Técnico trabajando sobre una placa madre" /><div class="visual-label"><span>01 / HARDWARE LAB</span><strong>PRECISIÓN<br />EN CADA COMPONENTE</strong></div><div class="visual-stamp">PCLAF<br /><small>TECH SERVICE</small></div></div></section>
    <section class="signal-bar"><span>PC DE ESCRITORIO</span><span>NOTEBOOKS</span><span>GAMING</span><span>UPGRADES</span><span>WINDOWS</span><span>DATA</span></section>
    <section class="services section" id="servicios"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Qué resolvemos</p><h2>Tu equipo tiene<br /><i>una segunda vida.</i></h2></div><p>Nos ocupamos de la parte difícil para que vos vuelvas a hacer lo importante. Sin tecnicismos innecesarios, sin sorpresas.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><a class="service-card service-main" href="/diagnostico-pc-notebook-floresta.html"><div class="card-top"><span>01</span><span>RECOMENDADO</span></div><div><h3>Diagnóstico<br /><i>y reparación</i></h3><p>Detectamos la falla, te mostramos el problema y te damos opciones reales para solucionarlo.</p></div><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a><a class="service-card" href="/limpieza-pc-gamer-floresta.html"><span class="card-top">02</span><h3>Limpieza<br /><i>profunda</i></h3><p>Temperaturas bajo control. Más rendimiento. Más años para tu equipo.</p><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a><a class="service-card" href="/optimizacion-pc-lenta-floresta.html"><span class="card-top">03</span><h3>Upgrade<br /><i>inteligente</i></h3><p>Mejoramos lo que importa sin hacerte gastar en lo que no necesitás.</p><span class="card-arrow">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="manifesto"><div class="manifesto-line"></div><p class="eyebrow">Nuestra forma de trabajar</p><h2>La tecnología puede ser compleja.<br /><span>La atención no.</span></h2><div class="manifesto-bottom"><p>Te contamos qué pasa, cuánto cuesta y qué alternativas tenés. La decisión siempre es tuya.</p><a class="text-link" href="/precios.html">Ver precios orientativos <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="process section"><div class="process-title"><p class="eyebrow">El proceso</p><h2>Tres pasos.<br /><i>Cero vueltas.</i></h2></div><div class="process-list"><div class="process-item"><span>01</span><div><h3>Reservás</h3><p>Elegís un turno y nos contás qué está pasando con tu equipo.</p></div><strong>→</strong></div><div class="process-item"><span>02</span><div><h3>Diagnosticamos</h3><p>Revisamos cada componente y te explicamos el hallazgo.</p></div><strong>→</strong></div><div class="process-item"><span>03</span><div><h3>Decidís</h3><p>Recibís un presupuesto claro. Reparamos solo cuando das el ok.</p></div><strong>✓</strong></div></div></section>
    <section class="booking"><div><p class="eyebrow">Listos cuando vos estés</p><h2>¿Tu equipo<br /><i>te está frenando?</i></h2><p>Traelo al taller o escribinos. Encontramos la forma de que vuelva a acompañarte.</p><a class="btn btn-orange" href="/turnos.html">Quiero reservar <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="booking-aside"><span class="status-dot"></span><strong>ATENCIÓN<br />PERSONALIZADA</strong><small>Campana 51 · Floresta</small></div></section>
  </main><footer><span>PCLAF / TECH SERVICE</span><span>Campana 51 · Floresta, CABA</span><a href="https://wa.me/5491135708345">WhatsApp ↗</a></footer>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
main{overflow:hidden}.hero,.section{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding-left:clamp(24px,6vw,80px);padding-right:clamp(24px,6vw,80px)}.hero{min-height:720px;padding-top:92px;padding-bottom:84px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .83fr;align-items:center;gap:8vw;position:relative}.hero-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.5;background-image:linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:90px 90px;mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#000 0%,transparent 74%);pointer-events:none}.eyebrow{font:500 11px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--orange)}.status-dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;margin-right:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lime);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #c8f35a22;animation:pulse 2s infinite}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(54px,7vw,102px);line-height:.91;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:24px 0 28px;font-weight:700;position:relative}.hero h1 span,h2 i{color:var(--orange);font-style:normal}.hero-text{max-width:450px;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.6}.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;margin-top:35px}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px;padding:17px 19px;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid transparent;transition:transform .25s,background .25s,color .25s}.btn-orange{background:var(--orange);color:var(--bg)}.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);background:var(--lime)}.btn span{font-size:19px}.text-link{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:6px;color:var(--text)}.text-link span{color:var(--orange);margin-left:9px}.hero-meta{display:flex;gap:25px;margin-top:55px;color:var(--muted);font:500 10px var(--mono);flex-wrap:wrap}.hero-meta b{color:var(--text);font-size:16px;margin-right:5px}.hero-visual{position:relative}.hero-visual img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(.3) contrast(1.12);display:block}.scan-line{height:1px;background:var(--orange);position:absolute;z-index:2;left:-25px;right:-25px;top:38%;box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--orange);animation:scan 4s ease-in-out infinite}.visual-label{position:absolute;left:18px;bottom:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}.visual-label span,.visual-stamp small{font:500 9px var(--mono);color:var(--orange)}.visual-label strong{font-size:18px;line-height:1.05}.visual-stamp{position:absolute;right:-24px;top:22px;border:1px solid var(--orange);color:var(--orange);padding:14px;text-align:center;font:700 17px var(--mono);transform:rotate(6deg)}.signal-bar{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 6vw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;color:var(--muted);font:500 10px var(--mono);white-space:nowrap;animation:marquee 22s linear infinite}.signal-bar span:nth-child(3){color:var(--lime)}.section{padding-top:145px;padding-bottom:145px}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:40px;margin-bottom:55px}.section-heading>p{max-width:300px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}.section h2,.manifesto h2,.booking h2{font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,72px);line-height:.96;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:18px 0 0}.service-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.service-card{min-height:370px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:25px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .3s,border-color .3s,background .3s}.service-card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);border-color:var(--orange);background:var(--surface-2)}.service-main{background:var(--orange);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--orange)}.service-main:hover{background:var(--lime);border-color:var(--lime)}.card-top{font:500 10px var(--mono);display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.card-top span:last-child{color:inherit;opacity:.65}.service-card h3{font-size:35px;line-height:.97;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:auto 0 20px}.service-card h3 i{font-style:normal;color:var(--orange)}.service-main h3 i{color:var(--bg);opacity:.65}.service-card p{max-width:280px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin:0}.service-main p{color:var(--bg);opacity:.72}.card-arrow{align-self:end;margin-top:25px;font-size:25px}.manifesto{background:var(--surface);padding:120px 9vw;position:relative}.manifesto-line{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:38%;height:3px;background:var(--orange)}.manifesto h2{font-size:clamp(45px,6vw,88px);margin-bottom:80px}.manifesto h2 span{color:var(--lime)}.manifesto-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:40px}.manifesto-bottom p{max-width:390px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1fr;gap:11vw}.process-title h2{font-size:clamp(44px,5vw,70px)}.process-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.process-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px 1fr 30px;align-items:start;gap:15px;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.process-item>span,.process-item>strong{font:500 11px var(--mono);color:var(--orange)}.process-item h3{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 9px}.process-item p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.process-item>strong{font-size:20px;text-align:right}.booking{background:var(--orange);color:var(--bg);padding:110px 9vw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:60px}.booking .eyebrow{color:var(--bg);opacity:.6}.booking h2{font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,105px)}.booking p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:410px;line-height:1.6}.booking .btn{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);margin-top:25px}.booking .btn:hover{background:var(--lime);color:var(--bg)}.booking-aside{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;border-left:1px solid #0b0d0f55;padding-left:22px;font:500 11px var(--mono)}.booking-aside .status-dot{background:var(--bg)}.booking-aside small{opacity:.65}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:26px 6vw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;color:var(--muted);font:500 10px var(--mono)}footer a{color:var(--orange);text-decoration:none}.reveal{animation:rise .9s both}.reveal-delay{animation:rise .9s .18s both}@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}@keyframes scan{0%,100%{top:25%;opacity:.4}50%{top:75%;opacity:1}}@keyframes pulse{50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 7px #c8f35a00}}@keyframes marquee{to{transform:translateX(-12%)}}@media(max-width:800px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:65px;gap:55px}.hero-visual{max-width:520px;margin:auto}.section{padding-top:90px;padding-bottom:90px}.section-heading,.manifesto-bottom{display:block}.section-heading>p{margin-top:25px}.service-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.service-card{min-height:300px}.process{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:55px}.booking{display:block;padding:85px 9vw}.booking-aside{margin-top:55px}.signal-bar{overflow:hidden;justify-content:flex-start}.visual-stamp{right:-7px}footer{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
